1. Install neovim
2. Install plug.vim
Command : sh -c 'curl -fLo "${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}"/nvim/site/autoload/plug.vim --create-dirs https://raw.githubusercontent.com/junegunn/vim-plug/master/plug.vim'
3. copy colors directory to ~/.config/nvim/
4. decompress bundle.zip to ~/.config/nvim
4.1 if not work, decompress bundle.zip to ~/.vim too.
4. customizing~
